{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03354","headline":"送杨六望赴金水 · 宋之问","name":"送杨六望赴金水","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"借问梁山道，嶔岑几万重。\n遥州刀作字，绝壁劒爲峰。\n惜别路穷此，留欢意不从。\n忧来生白发，时晚爱青松。\n勿以西南远，夷歌寝盛容。\n台阶有高位，宁复久临邛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03354.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03354","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}